{"results":[{"entryType":"UniProtKB reviewed (Swiss-Prot)","primaryAccession":"Q8WXG1","uniProtkbId":"RSAD2_HUMAN","proteinDescription":{"recommendedName":{"fullName":{"evidences":[{"evidenceCode":"ECO:0000303","source":"PubMed","id":"36387278"}],"value":"S-adenosylmethionine-dependent nucleotide dehydratase RSAD2"},"shortNames":[{"evidences":[{"evidenceCode":"ECO:0000303","source":"PubMed","id":"36387278"}],"value":"SAND"}],"ecNumbers":[{"evidences":[{"evidenceCode":"ECO:0000269","source":"PubMed","id":"29925952"},{"evidenceCode":"ECO:0000269","source":"PubMed","id":"30872404"}],"value":"4.2.-.-"}]},"alternativeNames":[{"fullName":{"evidences":[{"evidenceCode":"ECO:0000303","source":"PubMed","id":"9391139"}],"value":"Cytomegalovirus-induced gene 5 protein"}},{"fullName":{"evidences":[{"evidenceCode":"ECO:0000312","source":"HGNC","id":"HGNC:30908"}],"value":"Radical S-adenosyl methionine domain-containing protein 2"}},{"fullName":{"evidences":[{"evidenceCode":"ECO:0000303","source":"PubMed","id":"11752458"}],"value":"Virus inhibitory protein, endoplasmic reticulum-associated, interferon-inducible"},"shortNames":[{"evidences":[{"evidenceCode":"ECO:0000303","source":"PubMed","id":"11752458"},{"evidenceCode":"ECO:0000303","source":"PubMed","id":"30872404"},{"evidenceCode":"ECO:0000303","source":"PubMed","id":"31812350"}],"value":"Viperin"}]}]},"comments":[{"texts":[{"evidences":[{"evidenceCode":"ECO:0000269","source":"PubMed","id":"11752458"},{"evidenceCode":"ECO:0000269","source":"PubMed","id":"16108059"},{"evidenceCode":"ECO:0000269","source":"PubMed","id":"16982913"},{"evidenceCode":"ECO:0000269","source":"PubMed","id":"17686841"},{"evidenceCode":"ECO:0000269","source":"PubMed","id":"18005719"},{"evidenceCode":"ECO:0000269","source":"PubMed","id":"19074433"},{"evidenceCode":"ECO:0000269","source":"PubMed","id":"29925952"},{"evidenceCode":"ECO:0000269","source":"PubMed","id":"30587778"},{"evidenceCode":"ECO:0000269","source":"PubMed","id":"30872404"},{"evidenceCode":"ECO:0000269","source":"PubMed","id":"30934824"},{"evidenceCode":"ECO:0000269","source":"PubMed","id":"31812350"},{"evidenceCode":"ECO:0000269","source":"PubMed","id":"31921110"}],"value":"Interferon-inducible antiviral protein which plays a major role in the cell antiviral state induced by type I and type II interferon (PubMed:31812350). Catalyzes the conversion of cytidine triphosphate (CTP) to 3'-deoxy-3',4'-didehydro-CTP (ddhCTP) via a SAM-dependent radical mechanism (PubMed:29925952, PubMed:30872404). In turn, ddhCTP acts as a chain terminator for the RNA-dependent RNA polymerases from multiple viruses and directly inhibits viral replication (PubMed:29925952). Therefore, inhibits a wide range of DNA and RNA viruses, including human cytomegalovirus (HCMV), hepatitis C virus (HCV), west Nile virus (WNV), dengue virus, sindbis virus, influenza A virus, sendai virus, vesicular stomatitis virus (VSV), zika virus, and human immunodeficiency virus (HIV-1) (PubMed:29925952, PubMed:30587778, PubMed:30934824, PubMed:31921110). Also promotes TLR7 and TLR9-dependent production of IFN-beta production in plasmacytoid dendritic cells (pDCs) by facilitating 'Lys-63'-linked ubiquitination of IRAK1 by TRAF6 (PubMed:30872404). Plays a role in CD4+ T-cells activation and differentiation. Facilitates T-cell receptor (TCR)-mediated GATA3 activation and optimal T-helper 2 (Th2) cytokine production by modulating NFKB1 and JUNB activities. Can inhibit secretion of soluble proteins"}],"commentType":"FUNCTION"},{"commentType":"SUBCELLULAR LOCATION","note":{"texts":[{"value":"Infection with human cytomegalovirus (HCMV) causes relocation to the Golgi apparatus and to cytoplasmic vacuoles which also contain HCMV proteins glycoprotein B and pp28. Interaction with human cytomegalovirus/HHV-5 protein vMIA/UL37 results in its relocalization from the endoplasmic reticulum to the mitochondria"}]},"subcellularLocations":[{"location":{"value":"Endoplasmic reticulum membrane","id":"SL-0097"},"topolo